{"hero":{"id":17,"name":"Grey Talon","nameRu":"Серый Коготь","className":"hero_orion","description":"Уэсли Серый Коготь, один из основателей «Общества Бакстера», почти сорок лет охотился на терзавших людей монстров, прежде чем наконец решил найти себе замену и сложить лук. Обязанности не давали Серому Когтю уделять много времени жене и ребёнку, и теперь, когда его сын обзавёлся собственной семьёй, Уэсли понял, что это его последний шанс вновь сблизиться с дорогими ему людьми.<br><br>Выход на пенсию устраивал Уэсли. Он наверстывал упущенное с женой. Заботился о внуках. Каждую среду готовил ужин для всей семьи. Он был счастлив.<br><br>Но однажды ему позвонили.<br><br>Власти заявили, что это несчастный случай... Пожар охватил дом его сына так быстро, что не спасся никто. Но Уэсли знал, что это неправда. Его невестка была иксийкой, способной потушить пламя одной силой мысли, и если тела его родных нашли обгоревшими, они умерли задолго до пожара.<br><br>Серый Коготь снова взялся за лук, и когда он найдёт виновных, случится кровавая расплата.","descriptionEn":"Delivers long range skill-shots. A cunning predator, Grey Talon uses a combination of deadly accuracy, traps, and clever positioning to bring down the toughest of opponents.","lore":"A founding member of \"The Baxter Society\", Wesley Grey Talon spent close to 40 years hunting monsters that preyed on man before finally deciding to find a replacement and lay down his bow. Grey Talon's duties had meant that he never spent much time with his wife and kid, and now that his son had started a family of his own he realized that this was his last chance to reconnect with the people he loved.<br><br>Retirement suited Wesley.  He made up for lost time with his wife.  He doted on his grandkids.  He cooked dinner for the whole family every Wednesday.  He was happy.<br><br>Then he got the call.<br><br>The authorities claimed that it was a freak accident... that the fire consumed his son's house before anyone got a chance to escape.  But Wesley knew better.  His son's wife was an Ixian who could snuff out flame with a thought.  If their bodies were found burned they had to be dead long before there was a fire.<br><br>And so Grey Talon has picked up his bow once more, and when he finds who's responsible there will be a bloody reckoning.","heroRole":"Delivers long range skill-shots","tags":["Точность","Охотник","Контроль над областью"],"heroType":"mystic","complexity":2,"colorHex":"#5EB083","iconCard":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/archer_card.png","iconSmall":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/archer_sm.png","startingStats":{"max_move_speed":6.3,"sprint_speed":1.6,"crouch_speed":4.75,"move_acceleration":4,"light_melee_damage":50,"heavy_melee_damage":116,"max_health":780,"weapon_power":0,"reload_speed":1,"weapon_power_scale":1,"proc_build_up_rate_scale":1,"stamina":4,"base_health_regen":1.5,"stamina_regen_per_second":0.222222,"ability_resource_max":0,"ability_resource_regen_per_second":0,"crit_damage_received_scale":1,"tech_duration":1,"tech_range":1,"ground_dash_distance_in_meters":10,"ground_dash_duration":0.62,"air_dash_distance_in_meters":8,"air_dash_duration":0.43,"ooc_health_regen":0},"levelInfo":{"1":{"bonus_currencies":["EAbilityUnlocks"],"required_gold":0},"2":{"use_standard_upgrade":true,"bonus_currencies":["EAbilityPoints"],"required_gold":200},"3":{"use_standard_upgrade":true,"bonus_currencies":["EAbilityUnlocks"],"required_gold":500},"4":{"use_standard_upgrade":true,"bonus_currencies":["EAbilityPoints"],"required_gold":900},"5":{"use_standard_upgrade":true,"bonus_currencies":["EAbilityUnlocks"],"required_gold":1400},"6":{"use_standard_upgrade":true,"bonus_currencies":["EAbilityPoints"],"required_gold":2000},"7":{"use_standard_upgrade":true,"bonus_currencies":["EAbilityPoints"],"required_gold":2600},"8":{"use_standard_upgrade":true,"bonus_currencies":["EAbilityUnlocks"],"required_gold":3200},"9":{"use_standard