73V12.9755Z\" fill=\"black\" fill-opacity=\"0.6\"/>\n<path d=\"M59 12.9755C54.5695 14.5801 51.402 18.8335 51.402 23.8299V50.7515C51.402 55.7478 54.5696 60.0003 59 61.605V73.4277C43.5664 72.9935 31.718 69.6691 23.6324 66.3811C23.0701 66.1525 22.526 65.9235 22 65.6961C22.1325 63.8985 22.2887 62.0149 22.4731 60.0406L24.4194 44.5956C25.7871 35.6269 27.7049 26.7201 30.8669 20.6114C38.2105 6.41635 52.3489 4.72025 59 4.42773V12.9755Z\" fill=\"black\" fill-opacity=\"0.6\"/>\n</svg>\n, чтобы уменьшить высоту прыжка. <br>Нажмите Подпрыгнуть/забраться , чтобы вернуться на землю.","abilityType":"signature"},{"id":"512733154","name":"Spirit Snare","nameRu":"Спиритическая ловушка","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/archer/imobolize_trap.png","className":"ability_immobilize_trap","description":"<span class=\"highlight\">Throw out a trap</span> that begins to arm itself. Once armed, the trap will trigger when an enemy enters its radius, applying <span class=\"highlight\">Curse and Movement Slow</span> that <span class=\"highlight\">interrupts, Silences, Disarms</span>, and <span class=\"highlight\">prevents item usage</span>.<br>Hit the trap with a Charged Shot to detonate early with increased radius.","descriptionRu":"Серый Коготь <span class=\"highlight\">бросает ловушку</span>, которая начинает заряжаться. Когда в область действия заряженной ловушки попадает враг, она срабатывает, <span class=\"highlight\">снижая скорость передвижения жертв и накладывая проклятие</span>, которое <span class=\"highlight\">прерывает их действия, накладывает безмолвие и обезоруживание</span>, а также <span class=\"highlight\">предотвращает использование предметов</span>.<br>Попадите по ловушке «Заряженным выстрелом», чтобы она сработала раньше и с увеличенным радиусом.","abilityType":"signature"},{"id":"3242902780","name":"Guided Owl","nameRu":"Управляемая сова","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/archer/archer_guided_arrow.png","className":"ability_guided_arrow","description":"After 1.5s cast time, <span class=\"highlight\">launch a spirit owl that you control</span> and which explodes on impact, <span class=\"highlight\">damaging and stunning</span> enemies. Hold [W] to accelerate the owl.<br>Press Jump / mantle to release control. Gain <span class=\"highlight\">permanent Spirit Power</span> for each enemy hero killed with Guided Owl.","descriptionRu":"После подготовки в 1.5 сек. Серый Коготь <span class=\"highlight\">выпускает призрачную сову</span>, которая следует его командам и взрывается при столкновении, <span class=\"highlight\">нанося урон и оглушая врагов</span>. Удерживайте [W] , чтобы ускорить сову.<br>Нажмите Подпрыгнуть/забраться , чтобы взорвать сову. За каждого вражеского героя, убитого совой, <span class=\"highlight\">навсегда даётся спиритическая мощь</span>.","abilityType":"ultimate"},{"id":"2573821048","name":"Knocked off Zipline","nameRu":"Падение с зиплайна","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_zip_line","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"1466127517","name":"Jump","nameRu":"Прыжок","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_jump","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"2335418656","name":"Slide","nameRu":"Скольжение","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_slide","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"875395762","name":"citadel_ability_zipline_boost","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/upgrades/mods_utility/zipline_mastery.png","className":"citadel_ability_zipline_boost","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"4109126631","name":"Mantle","nameRu":"Преодоление препятствия","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_mantle","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"4261702459","name":"citadel_ability_climb_rope","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_climb_rope","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"1443159618","name":"","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/hud/icons/icon_speed.svg","className":"citadel_ability_sprint","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"2207638101","name":"Dash","nameRu":"Рывок","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_dash","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"664285540","name":"Parry","nameRu":"Парирование","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_melee_parry","description":"","abilityType":"innate"}],"updatedAt":"2026-11-16T00:40:59.509Z"}}